<title>USA: York Cty, S.C., $5.095 mln won by First Union.</title>
<headline>York Cty, S.C., $5.095 mln won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp. said it won $5.095 million of York Cty SD 1, S.C., school building bonds, 1997 Series B, with a true interest cost of 4.66 percent.</p>
